{"zone":{"id":1583,"name":"Blackrock Spire","kind":"dungeon","entrance":{"zone":51,"x":34.8,"y":85.3},"levels":[59,60],"quests":{"A":30,"H":31}},"quests":[{"id":4788,"name":"The Final Tablets","level":58,"minLevel":40,"side":"B","xp":7750,"text":"Bring the Fifth and Sixth Mosh'aru Tablets to Prospector Ironboot in Tanaris.","start":{"npcs":[10460]},"end":{"npcs":[10460]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":12740},{"type":"item","id":12741}],"preAny":[5065],"next":8181,"zone":1583},{"id":4701,"name":"Put Her Down","level":59,"minLevel":55,"side":"A","xp":6400,"text":"Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy the source of the worg menace. As you left Helendis, he shouted a name: Halycon. It is what the orcs refer to in regards to the worg.","start":{"npcs":[9562]},"end":{"npcs":[9562]},"objectives":[{"type":"npc","id":10220}],"zone":1583},{"id":4724,"name":"The Pack Mistress","level":59,"minLevel":55,"side":"H","xp":6400,"text":"Slay Halycon, pack mistress of the Bloodaxe worg.","start":{"npcs":[9081]},"end":{"npcs":[9081]},"objectives":[{"type":"npc","id":10220}],"zone":1583},{"id":4729,"name":"Kibler's Exotic Pets","level":59,"minLevel":55,"side":"B","xp":6400,"text":"Travel to Blackrock Spire and find Bloodaxe Worg Pups. Use the cage to carry the ferocious little beasts. Bring back a Caged Worg Pup to Kibler.","start":{"npcs":[10260]},"end":{"npcs":[10260]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":12263}],"givenItem":12262,"zone":1583},{"id":4862,"name":"En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why","level":59,"minLevel":55,"side":"B","xp":6400,"text":"Travel to Blackrock Spire and collect 15 Spire Spider Eggs for Kibler.  By the sound of it, these eggs could be found near spiders. ","start":{"npcs":[10260]},"end":{"npcs":[10260]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":12530}],"zone":1583},{"id":4981,"name":"Operative Bijou","level":59,"minLevel":55,"side":"H","xp":6400,"text":"Travel to Blackrock Spire and find out what happened to Bijou.","start":{"npcs":[9080]},"end":{"npcs":[10257]},"next":4982,"zone":1583},{"id":4982,"name":"Bijou's Belongings","level":59,"minLevel":55,"side":"H","xp":6400,"text":"Find Bijou's Belongings and return them to her. You recall her mentioning that she stashed them on the bottom floor of the city. ","start":{"npcs":[10257]},"end":{"npcs":[10257]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":12345}],"preAny":[4981],"next":4983,"zone":1583},{"id":4983,"name":"Bijou's Reconnaissance Report","level":59,"minLevel":55,"side":"H","xp":6400,"text":"Take Bijou's Reconnaissance Report back to Grandmaster Lexlort in Kargath. ","start":{"npcs":[10257]},"end":{"npcs":[9080]},"givenItem":12652,"preAny":[4982],"zone":1583},{"id":5001,"name":"Bijou's Belongings","level":59,"minLevel":55,"side":"A","xp":6400,"text":"Find Bijou's Belongings and return them to her. Good luck! ","start":{"npcs":[10257]},"end":{"npcs":[10257]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":12345}],"next":5002,"zone":1583},{"id":5002,"name":"Message to Maxwell","level":59,"minLevel":55,"side":"A","xp":6400,"text":"Travel to the Burning Steppes and give Bijou's Information to Marshal Maxwell.","start":{"npcs":[10257]},"end":{"npcs":[9560]},"givenItem":12770,"preAny":[5001],"next":5081,"zone":1583},{"id":8644,"name":"Stonefort the Elder","level":60,"minLevel":1,"side":"B","start":{"npcs":[15560]},"end":{"npcs":[15560]},"category":"Lunar Festival","zone":1583},{"id":6502,"name":"Drakefire Amulet","level":60,"minLevel":50,"side":"A","xp":8300,"text":"You must retrieve the Blood of the Black Dragon Champion from General Drakkisath. Drakkisath can be found in his throne room behind the Halls of Ascension in Blackrock Spire.","start":{"npcs":[10929]},"end":{"npcs":[10929]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":16663}],"preAny":[6501],"zone":1583},{"id":4866,"name":"Mother's Milk","level":60,"minLevel":55,"side":"B","xp":9950,"text":"In the heart of Blackrock Spire you will find Mother Smolderweb. Engage her and get her to poison you. Chances are good that you will have to kill her as well. Return to Ragged John when you are poisoned so that he can 'milk' you.","start":{"npcs":[9563]},"end":{"npcs":[9563]},"objectives":[{"type":"npc","id":9563}],"zone":1583},{"id":4867,"name":"Urok Doomhowl","level":60,"minLevel":55,"side":"B","xp":9950,"text":"Read Warosh's Scroll. Bring Warosh's Mojo to Warosh.","start":{"npcs":[10799]},"end":{"npcs":[10799]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":12712}],"givenItem":12730,"zone":1583},{"id":4903,"name":"Warlord's Command","level":60,"minLevel":55,"side":"H","xp":8300,"text":"Slay Highlord Omokk, War Master Voone, and Overlord Wyrmthalak. Recover Important Blackrock Documents. Return to Warlord Goretooth in Kargath when the mission has been accomplished.","start":{"npcs":[9077],"items":[12563]},"end":{"npcs":[9077]},"objectives":[{"type":"npc","id":9568},{"type":"npc","id":9196},{"type":"npc","id":9237},{"type":"item","id":12562}],"next":4941,"zone":1583},{"id":4974,"name":"For The Horde!","level":60,"minLevel":55,"side":"H","xp":9950,"text":"Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay Warchief Rend Blackhand. Take his head and return to Orgrimmar.","start":{"npcs":[4949]},"end":{"npcs":[4949]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":12630}],"preAny":[4941],"next":6566,"zone":1583},{"id":5047,"name":"Pip Quickwit, At Your Service!","level":60,"minLevel":55,"side":"B","xp":6600,"text":"Talk to Malyfous Darkhammer in Everlook.","start":{"npcs":[10776]},"end":{"npcs":[10637]},"givenItem":12710,"zone":1583},{"id":5081,"name":"Maxwell's Mission","level":60,"minLevel":55,"side":"A","xp":8300,"text":"Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy War Master Voone, Highlord Omokk, and Overlord Wyrmthalak. Return to Marshal Maxwell when the job is done.","start":{"npcs":[9560]},"end":{"npcs":[9560]},"objectives":[{"type":"npc","id":9237},{"type":"npc","id":9196},{"type":"npc","id":9568}],"preAny":[5002],"zone":1583},{"id":5089,"name":"General Drakkisath's Command","level":60,"minLevel":55,"side":"A","xp":6600,"text":"Take General Drakkisath's Command to Marshal Maxwell in Burning Steppes.","start":{"items":[12780]},"end":{"npcs":[9560]},"givenItem":12780,"next":5102,"zone":1583},{"id":5102,"name":"General Drakkisath's Demise","level":60,"minLevel":55,"side":"A","xp":9950,"text":"Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy General Drakkisath. Return to Marshal Maxwell when the job is done. ","start":{"npcs":[9560]},"end":{"npcs":[9560]},"objectives":[{"type":"npc","id":10363}],"preAny":[5089],"zone":1583},{"id":5103,"name":"Hot Fiery Death","level":60,"minLevel":55,"side":"B","xp":6600,"text":"Someone in this world must know what to do with these gauntlets. Good luck!","start":{"objects":[176090]},"end":{"npcs":[10637]},"next":5124,"category":"Blacksmithing","zone":1583},{"id":5127,"name":"The Demon Forge","level":60,"minLevel":55,"side":"B","xp":8300,"text":"Travel to Blackrock Spire and find Goraluk Anvilcrack. Slay him and then use the Blood Stained Pike upon his corpse. After his soul has been siphoned, the pike will be Soul Stained.  You must also find the Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate.  Return both the Soul Stained Pike and the Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate to Lorax in Winterspring.","start":{"npcs":[10918]},"end":{"npcs":[10918]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":12847},{"type":"item","id":12806}],"givenItem":12848,"preAny":[5126],"zone":1583},{"id":6569,"name":"Oculus Illusions","level":60,"minLevel":55,"side":"H","xp":6600,"text":"Travel to Blackrock Spire and collect 20 Black Dragonspawn Eyes. Return to Myranda the Hag when the task is complete.","start":{"npcs":[11872]},"end":{"npcs":[11872]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":16786}],"preAny":[6568],"next":6570,"zone":1583},{"id":6602,"name":"Blood of the Black Dragon Champion","level":60,"minLevel":55,"side":"H","xp":9950,"text":"Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay General Drakkisath. Gather his blood and return it to Rexxar.","start":{"npcs":[10182]},"end":{"npcs":[10182]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":16663}],"preAny":[6601],"zone":1583},{"id":7761,"name":"Blackhand's Command","level":60,"minLevel":55,"side":"B","xp":6600,"text":"That is one stupid orc. It would appear as if you need to find this brand and gain the Mark of Drakkisath in order to access the Orb of Command.  The letter indicates that General Drakkisath guards the brand. Perhaps you should investigate.","start":{"items":[18987]},"end":{"objects":[179880]},"zone":1583},{"id":98325,"name":"Blood and Thunder","level":60,"minLevel":55,"side":"H","text":"Speak to Warlord Goretooth to serve the Kargath Expeditionary Force.","zone":1583},{"id":4734,"name":"Egg Freezing","level":60,"minLevel":57,"side":"B","xp":8300,"text":"Use the Eggscilloscope Prototype on an egg in the Rookery.","start":{"npcs":[10267]},"end":{"npcs":[10267]},"objectives":[{"type":"object","id":175124}],"givenItem":12286,"preAny":[4810],"breadcrumbs":[4907],"next":4735,"zone":1583},{"id":4735,"name":"Egg Collection","level":60,"minLevel":57,"side":"B","xp":9950,"text":"Bring 8 Collected Dragon Eggs and the Collectronic Module to Tinkee Steamboil at Flame Crest in the Burning Steppes.","start":{"npcs":[10267]},"end":{"npcs":[10267]},"objectives":[{"type":"object","id":175124}],"givenItem":12287,"preAny":[4734],"next":5522,"zone":1583},{"id":4742,"name":"Seal of Ascension","level":60,"minLevel":57,"side":"B","xp":8300,"text":"Find the three gemstones of command: The Gemstone of Smolderthorn, Gemstone of Spirestone, and Gemstone of Bloodaxe. Return them, along with the Unadorned Seal of Ascension, to Vaelan.  The Generals, as told to you by Vaelan, are: War Master Voone of the Smolderthorn; Highlord Omokk of the Spirestone; and Overlord Wyrmthalak of the Bloodaxe.","start":{"npcs":[10299]},"end":{"npcs":[10299]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":12336},{"type":"item","id":12335},{"type":"item","id":12337},{"type":"item","id":12219}],"next":4743,"zone":1583},{"id":4743,"name":"Seal of Ascension","level":60,"minLevel":57,"side":"B","xp":9950,"text":"Travel to the Wyrmbog in Dustwallow Marsh. Find the ancient drake, Emberstrife and beat him without mercy until his will is broken.  It is at that moment which you must place the Unforged Seal of Ascension before the great beast. You must then be quick to use the Orb of Draconic Energy on his weakened form and claim dominion over his mental faculties. Control the beast and force the Flames of the Black Dragonflight upon the Unforged Seal of Ascension!","start":{"npcs":[10299]},"end":{"npcs":[10299]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":12324}],"givenItem":12339,"preAny":[4742],"zone":1583},{"id":4764,"name":"Doomrigger's Clasp","level":60,"minLevel":57,"side":"A","xp":1650,"text":"Bring Doomrigger's Clasp to Mayara Brightwing in the Burning Steppes.","start":{"npcs":[9565]},"end":{"npcs":[9565]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":12352}],"breadcrumbs":[4766],"next":4765,"zone":1583},{"id":4765,"name":"Delivery to Ridgewell","level":60,"minLevel":57,"side":"A","xp":6600,"text":"Bring Ridgewell's Crate to Remington Ridgewell in Stormwind.","start":{"npcs":[9565]},"end":{"npcs":[2285]},"givenItem":12437,"preAny":[4764],"zone":1583},{"id":4766,"name":"Mayara Brightwing","level":60,"minLevel":57,"side":"A","xp":660,"text":"Speak with Mayara Brightwing in the Burning Steppes.","start":{"npcs":[2285]},"end":{"npcs":[9565]},"next":4764,"breadcrumbFor":4764,"zone":1583},{"id":4768,"name":"The Darkstone Tablet","level":60,"minLevel":57,"side":"H","xp":8300,"text":"Bring the Darkstone Tablet to Shadow Mage Vivian Lagrave in Kargath.","start":{"npcs":[9078]},"end":{"npcs":[9078]},"objectives":[{"type":"item","id":12358}],"breadcrumbs":[4769],"zone":1583},{"id":4769,"name":"Vivian Lagrave and the Darkstone Tablet","level":60,"minLevel":57,"side":"H","xp":660,"text":"Speak with Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave.","start":{"npcs":[5204]},"end":{"npcs":[9078]},"next":4768,"breadcrumbFor":4768,"zone":1583},{"id":4907,"name":"Tinkee Steamboil","level":60,"minLevel":57,"side":"B","xp":660,"text":"Speak with Tinkee Steamboil.","start":{"npcs":[10468]},"e